 things that  he's really proud about is that he's  kind of like a southern guy west  virginia guy he didn't like go to any  fancy college or anything like that but  he like worked his way up and made  himself like invaluable by pretty much  knowing everything about how this whole  facility functions and he got to a point  where they couldn't really manage the  place without him and he's actually like  really proud of being able to do that  even though like i said he's not from  some elite school or anything like that  and he's also really kind of like earned  the respect and the friendship of  everybody who works there he's like i  said very down to earth very folksy and  he thinks that he gets a lot better  results by being friends with him his  employees like being warm with them but  being firm you know kind of like giving  him some leeway and like shooting the  [ __ ] and everything like that instead of  like being like a hard ass or like  really authoritarian  so what exactly does this facility do  you might ask now i will warn you like i  said i'm not going to spoil the ending  or anything like that but just as with a  lot of these videos i tend to go like a  little bit in depth about what's going  on with the plot and i know that some  people would rather just come to  stories like without knowing anything  about them and i'm like that too which  is why i don't read or reviews or watch  reviews of movies or books or anything  like that until after i've seen them  because i'm interested in other people's  perspective on it so if you want to come  into this like not knowing anything else  about it obviously then stop now and  turn back and like go read it it's free  on kindle unlimited and then come back  and talk about it like i said i'm not  going to spoil the ending but you might  not want to know some of the stuff that  i'm going to talk about from this point  forward so you have been warned  so what does this facility do  now if you've ever read anything 